    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Project Property Occupying a Prominent Corner Position\n\nNumber 17 High Hill Street is a compact end of terrace property extending to c. 45 sq m and offering excellent potential for refurbishment and redevelopment. The property requires renovation throughout, making it an ideal project for a builder, investor or purchaser seeking to create a home to their own specification and finish in this highly convenient location. The ground floor is arranged around an open-plan living room and kitchen, with access to a small enclosed rear yard and utility area. Upstairs there are two bedrooms, each with its own ensuite shower room, providing a surprisingly practical layout for a property of this size. 17 High Hill Street represents an exciting refurbishment opportunity with considerable potential to add value. Viewing is recommended.\n\nAccommodation\nEntrance Porch 1.3m x 0.9m\nLiving room 3.8m x 2.75m open plan to \nKitchen 3.56m x 2.91m\nOutside utility 2.4m x 1.3m \nBedroom 1. 2.9m x 2.8m plus en-suite shower room 2.7m x 0.8m\nBedroom 2. 2.6m x 2.5m plus en-suite shower room 2.6m x 0.8m\n\n \nOUTSIDE: Enclosed rear yard and shed/ utility room \nSERVICES: All main services \nBER: G No. 114128119\nEIRCODE: Y34NX06\nVIEWING: By prior appointment\n\n"
